join creative_interviewer center

creative_interviewer: Apa software design favorit anda?

[signal arg="timer_start"]

- Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, etc)
	set {interview_score} += 15
	set {interview_health} += 15
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	creative_interviewer: Industry standard! Perfect choice for professional work.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- Figma dan Canva
	set {interview_score} += 10
	set {interview_health} += 10
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	creative_interviewer: Modern tools! Good for UI/UX and quick designs.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- Paint dan PowerPoint
	set {interview_score} -= 5
	set {interview_health} -= 5
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	creative_interviewer: That's... very basic. We need professional tools here.
	[signal arg="wrong_choice"]

- Saya gambar pakai tangan aja
	set {interview_score} += 5
	set {interview_health} += 5
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	creative_interviewer: Traditional art is great, but we need digital skills too.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

[wait time="1.0"]
[signal arg="update_ui"]

leave creative_interviewer
